----------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
----------------------------------------------------------------

This product is stdlib-only on the Go side (no third-party Go dependencies).

Frontend dependencies (see frontend/package.json) are pinned via
frontend/package-lock.json and are licensed under their respective upstream
licenses (predominantly MIT and Apache-2.0). A CycloneDX SBOM for any
released image is generated by syft and attached to the image via
cosign attest — see .github/workflows/composer-security.yml.

The catalog of MCP adapter sources advertised by /api/templates points to
each adapter's upstream maintainer; those adapters are not redistributed by
this project.
